edition ObjectiveBend 1
# The Tally activity (world/activity/Tally.obend) born with a total of 0, decided by
# one subject: the program the checkpoint-transparency gate and the ForcingTransparent
# points (Kernel/ObjectiveResumeContract) run. The argument wire carries no variants,
# so the Start record is built here.
import ./Tally.obend as Tally
def fromZero(decider: Nat) -> Activity<Tally.Plan, Tally.Resumed, Nat>:
  Tally.tally({init: Tally.EditNat.set(0n), decider: decider})
